Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:23.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,Now we're married, aren't we,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:26.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,We are, Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,Only in the world of {\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0}, but we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:33.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,Here, all we have are hearts that \Nbelieve in each other's humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.64,Default,H,0,0,0,,This may be a true, pure love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.28,Default,H,0,0,0,,Let's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.81,0:00:47.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,I like it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:49.53,Default,H,0,0,0,,I want to keep dreaming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.41,0:00:53.32,Default,H,0,0,0,,I like you this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:55.46,Default,H,0,0,0,,Himiko...
