Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:34.76,Italics,H,0,0,0,,If they're farther away in my next scan, we won't have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:47.82,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:55.46,Italics,H,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.76,Italics,H,0,0,0,,He attacked me with a knife, not a BIM?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.79,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:02.52,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why did you attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.52,0:03:06.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't you think trying to kill each other is stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:10.53,Default,H,0,0,0,,Stop this, and work with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.53,0:03:12.14,Default,H,0,0,0,,We'll escape together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:14.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:19.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,No plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,You can't beat a BIM with a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.86,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,First persuasion, then threats?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:31.23,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I hate selfish kids like you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:33.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,Say what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you try to follow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:47.75,Italics,S,0,0,0,,So it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,They're working together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:00.55,Default,T,0,0,0,,An explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:03.24,Default,T,0,0,0,,That's where Sakamoto went, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.88,Default,T,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:11.74,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,He has three types of BIMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:14.94,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,For all your talk, you're a murderer yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:22.66,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,There isn't any point in wasting BIMs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:26.18,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,Mr. Miyamoto, stab him with your knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.41,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,If you want, I could—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:36.38,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,Damn it! What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.22,Default,Lawyer,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:40.72,Italics,S,0,0,0,,The stun gun's getting weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:43.19,Default,L,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:44.50,Default,L,0,0,0,,That stupid kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:47.26,Default,L,0,0,0,,Mr. Miyamoto, go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:49.88,Default,M,0,0,0,,I was planning to let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:55.02,Default,M,0,0,0,,This is what he said to me:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.99,Default,M,0,0,0,,"Work with us."
