Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.24,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:08.46,Default,T,0,0,0,,You took your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:09.80,Default,T,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,but my BIMs were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,You didn't let them follow you, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:19.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:21.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,I took the longest way back I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:24.98,Default,S,0,0,0,,And they weren't using their radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,They must have lost track of me by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.30,Default,H,0,0,0,,Radar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.34,Default,H,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:31.89,Default,H,0,0,0,,They could use footprints or other traces like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:34.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,No, I can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.52,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,Give me back my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,There's only one trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:42.35,Default,H,0,0,0,,Then give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:43.49,Default,S,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:45.52,Default,H,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:51.56,Default,M,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:53.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,H-How did you find us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.94,Default,M,0,0,0,,I used to be a mercenary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:59.42,Default,M,0,0,0,,Tracking someone in the jungle is simple for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:01.92,Default,M,0,0,0,,We meet again, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:06.05,Default,M,0,0,0,,When I saw his stun gun, I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:09.43,Default,M,0,0,0,,If I followed him, we might meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:15.32,Default,M,0,0,0,,Are those the BIMs and the \Nfood you took from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.77,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'm taking them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.19,Default,M,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, wasn't that fat-ass Akechi with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.92,Default,M,0,0,0,,You killed him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.11,Default,M,0,0,0,,Do you have his chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:29.94,Default,H,0,0,0,,I-It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.91,Default,H,0,0,0,,I did nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.70,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't know where his chip is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:35.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:37.02,Default,M,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.00,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll just strip search you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:41.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,Leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:46.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.76,Default,M,0,0,0,,You {\i1}still{\i0} don't understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:53.62,Default,M,0,0,0,,This island is hell. You live or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:56.52,Default,M,0,0,0,,It's impossible to escape on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:07:01.40,Default,M,0,0,0,,The only way out is to kill \Nothers and take their chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:05.76,Default,M,0,0,0,,Don't you want to get eight chips and leave this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:08.70,Default,M,0,0,0,,If you ask me, the people playing the game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.45,Default,M,0,0,0,,are the sane ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:13.98,Default,S,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:20.11,Default,S,0,0,0,,No matter what's going on, murder is never justified!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:22.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,This is a game someone made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:26.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,A game this size must have \Nbalancing issues somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:32.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,I worked as a debugger for Tyrannos Japan, the guys who are probably running this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,So somehow, I can tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,This game isn't complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's still being developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:40.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,There's a loophole somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:41.98,Default,S,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:48.92,Default,M,0,0,0,,Your plan is nothing but a child's foolish optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.24,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:51.66,Default,M,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.64,Default,M,0,0,0,,Getting that chip is gonna be a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.27,Default,M,0,0,0,,Right, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:26.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,H-Himiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:36.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:49.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,I fell from up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Th-The others!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:57.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:02.31,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:04.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need to stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,The trunk... and the BIMs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:08.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,He took them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:10.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,Did he take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:18.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:22.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:35.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:37.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,A type theta cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:41.43,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:43.69,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.44,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No way. Then she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:48.46,Italics,S,0,0,0,,{\i0}my{\i1} Himiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:52.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,I have to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,and save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:55.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:09:59.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,No! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:02.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:04.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can't handle any more waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:08.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need clean towels and water for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:12.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:13.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:14.80,Default,T,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.96,Default,T,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.80,Default,T,0,0,0,,This time, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:23.64,Default,T,0,0,0,,If you leave me here, I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.73,Default,T,0,0,0,,I won't be able to stay sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:29.26,Default,T,0,0,0,,Please, stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:35.74,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:39.74,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:56.15,Default,L,0,0,0,,That's good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.22,Default,L,0,0,0,,I feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:57.22,Overlap,H,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.22,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's my food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.60,Default,M,0,0,0,,You bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:08.34,Default,M,0,0,0,,It was mine before you stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:11.01,Default,H,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.01,0:11:13.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,I won't fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:15.65,Default,H,0,0,0,,In exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:19.10,Default,H,0,0,0,,Let me die pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:27.37,Default,M,0,0,0,,Do you think that's why I brought you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:31.50,Default,M,0,0,0,,There are better forms of \Nentertainment on a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:35.96,Default,M,0,0,0,,Torturing the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:38.97,Default,M,0,0,0,,Flaying.{CR had "Lynching." As far as I'm aware, lynching is execution by a mob, so I changed it to flaying, which is what is described in the following lines.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.72,Default,M,0,0,0,,Like peeling the skin off an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:48.23,Default,M,0,0,0,,Tear off all the skin, and see how long they survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:53.23,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll make your body pure, just the way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.16,Default,M,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.12,Default,L,0,0,0,,That was radar, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:06.16,Italics,M,0,0,0,,That old guy with the Kansai accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.37,Italics,M,0,0,0,,Or was it another player?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.04,Default,M,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:17.58,Default,L,0,0,0,,They each fired their radar twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:19.30,Default,L,0,0,0,,Do you think it's some kind of signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:22.05,Default,M,0,0,0,,That means it's probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:26.36,Italics,M,0,0,0,,That kid survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:36.02,Default,L,0,0,0,,The squall's passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:38.78,Default,M,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:41.84,Default,M,0,0,0,,You head to the front hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.72,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll go around from the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.62,Default,M,0,0,0,,We took all his BIMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.79,Default,M,0,0,0,,He's unarmed, so don't screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.04,Default,L,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:58.06,Default,M,0,0,0,,Your BIMs have a ten-second \Ndelay before they explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:13:01.64,Default,M,0,0,0,,Set them to three so you don't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.52,Default,L,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.81,Default,M,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:14.18,Italics,L,0,0,0,,He's heading toward Natsume.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.81,Italics,L,0,0,0,,The fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:18.32,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I can tell exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:22.32,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Natsume, did you get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:28.14,Italics,L,0,0,0,,He's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.31,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Did Natsume miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:31.52,Italics,L,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:34.32,Italics,L,0,0,0,,If there isn't another explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:35.83,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Did he get Natsume?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.24,Italics,L,0,0,0,,He's heading straight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.16,Italics,L,0,0,0,,That means he'll be coming through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:47.26,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I'll take him in one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:51.35,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Do you think I can't hear you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:52.98,Italics,L,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:58.72,Default,L,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:13:59.69,Default,L,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:03.57,Default,L,0,0,0,,I-I saw him, so I attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:05.98,Default,L,0,0,0,,But he disappeared completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:09.58,Default,L,0,0,0,,Is it possible to completely disintegrate someone so there's nothing left?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:11.58,Default,M,0,0,0,,Of course not, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.32,Default,M,0,0,0,,Look harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:25.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm certain she was around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:39.78,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:42.16,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That was a military-style trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:45.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But I avoided it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.41,0:14:48.53,Italics,S,0,0,0,,And I got a valuable BIM.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:52.70,Italics,S,0,0,0,,A BIM that's been disabled becomes\N the property of whoever disarmed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:55.42,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I proved that with her BIM.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:15:00.66,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Maybe with this, I can make a miracle happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:20.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,I've come to save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:28.20,Default,H,0,0,0,,H-How do you know that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:33.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sorry, I saw your phone wallpaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:38.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,You played {\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0} as "Himiko," didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:40.54,Default,H,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:42.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,It isn't my real name, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:45.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,My name is Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:46.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:50.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's possible we've played together a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:58.63,Default,H,0,0,0,,I know the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:01.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,If you mean the world-ranked player,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:03.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,then you were famous among my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:06.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,But the name is all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.30,Default,H,0,0,0,,We've never played together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,It wasn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:20.58,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't play that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.60,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:26.16,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That game sold three million copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:28.26,Italics,S,0,0,0,,There was bound to be users sharing the same name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:34.26,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But I got the courage to come this far because I thought it was Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.26,Italics,S,0,0,0,,So from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:39.60,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I'll just have to believe in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:49.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,Even if it's not your real name, can I call you Himiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:52.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,I guess I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:57.82,Default,M,0,0,0,,That bastard's with the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:17:00.79,Default,L,0,0,0,,He never showed up on the radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:03.60,Italics,M,0,0,0,,He made it through the trap and into the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.04,Italics,M,0,0,0,,Christ... The radar, the BIMs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:09.78,Italics,M,0,0,0,,I knew this was the only thing I could trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:14.18,Default,M,0,0,0,,There are only two ways down from that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:16.16,Default,M,0,0,0,,You go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.82,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll get the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.90,Default,M,0,0,0,,Don't screw it up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:20.80,Default,L,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.31,Default,L,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:27.50,Default,L,0,0,0,,Penal Code Section 361 Article 1, self-defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:34.64,Default,L,0,0,0,,Necessary actions taken in defense of a pressing and illegal threat are not punishable by law!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:39.83,Default,L,0,0,0,,Self-defense! Self-defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:42.42,Default,L,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.42,Default,L,0,0,0,,Die, die, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.55,Default,L,0,0,0,,Unarmed fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:51.88,Default,L,0,0,0,,I can't die in this crazy world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:57.51,Default,L,0,0,0,,I am an elite lawyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.53,0:18:01.70,Default,L,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:04.14,Default,L,0,0,0,,That leads to a dead end...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:14.76,Default,M,0,0,0,,Not bad, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.40,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.49,Default,M,0,0,0,,But I've got the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:21.98,Default,M,0,0,0,,Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:25.25,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance: an unarmed fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.58,Default,M,0,0,0,,It's not a bad deal, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.00,Default,M,0,0,0,,Now, come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:33.30,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If I can get that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:37.26,Default,M,0,0,0,,Your pouch had three BIM types.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:40.25,Default,M,0,0,0,,You should have at least two chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:43.92,Default,M,0,0,0,,This girl killed that fat-ass Akechi, \Nso she has one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:45.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,I said I don't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:47.77,Default,M,0,0,0,,You're still playing dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:49.66,Default,M,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:52.48,Default,M,0,0,0,,You should have three between you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.78,Default,M,0,0,0,,Once I kill you, I can take my time looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.84,Default,M,0,0,0,,Natsume, the guy with the Kansai accent,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and the one I killed before make eight total.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.79,Default,M,0,0,0,,That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:06.22,Default,M,0,0,0,,So get on out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:10.28,Default,M,0,0,0,,If you beat me, you can get all eight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:16.42,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.27,Default,M,0,0,0,,The knife's the first thing most people go for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:30.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.89,Default,M,0,0,0,,I won't let you die easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.66,Default,M,0,0,0,,I said to fight barehanded,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.66,0:19:48.82,Default,M,0,0,0,,but you ignored me and went for the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:50.90,Default,M,0,0,0,,That's against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:57.17,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is this the end of the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:20:00.22,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Life didn't work out the way I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:03.93,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I thought it would somehow, but it never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.68,Italics,S,0,0,0,,A life wasted on games...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:10.72,Italics,S,0,0,0,,If I could have at least met the real Himiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.53,Default,M,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:23.60,Default,M,0,0,0,,You bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:25.83,Default,H,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:27.36,Default,M,0,0,0,,What did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:30.12,Default,M,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.12,Default,H,0,0,0,,Run! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.01,Default,M,0,0,0,,She triggered the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:40.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,The gas is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:40.88,Default,H,0,0,0,,Where's the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:48.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,A dead end?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:49.54,Default,H,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:20:59.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:03.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.19,0:21:08.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:14.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:20.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,Just a little further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:24.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:29.02,Italics,M,0,0,0,,I-I'll show you hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:33.27,Italics,M,0,0,0,,The real hell that I saw on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:35.70,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:37.40,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:42.48,Italics,M,0,0,0,,A timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:43.96,Italics,M,0,0,0,,Why would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:47.52,Italics,M,0,0,0,,It'll be ten seconds until it explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.17,Italics,M,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:50.58,Italics,M,0,0,0,,I'll make it mine and use it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:55.29,Italics,M,0,0,0,,Set them to three so you don't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:57.79,Italics,M,0,0,0,,He took Natsume's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.09,0:22:19.18,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Wow!
